  "name": "Path to Ascension: applying Mystic Enchants, collection activation and presets verify their tutorials",
  "contract": "Tutorial.dbc names Mystic Enchant slot tutorials. 52 (classes 0x7ff, excludes game modes 0x840) reads 'Apply a Mystic Enchant Scroll.', 59 (Hero only, class mask 0x200, excludes 0x848) 'Apply Mystic Enchants in all 17 Active Enchant Slots.', 60 (0x7ff) 'Apply a Legendary Enchant to your Legendary Active Enchant Slot.', 61 (0x7ff) 'Have 3 Epic Enchants applied to Active Enchant Slots.', 39 (0x7ff, excludes 0x40) and its copy 277 (0x5ff, no Hero) 'Activate a Mystic Enchant from your Enchant Collection at an Altar.' and 62 (0x7ff, excludes 0x40) 'Change your Mystic Enchanting Specialization.', read as activating a different preset. Expected: a Hero applying one scroll verifies 52, a Legendary verifies 60, the third active Epic verifies 61 and the 17th filled slot verifies 59, each not before. A Warrior activating a known enchant from the collection verifies 39 and 277, a Hero 39 only. Re-activating the current preset verifies nothing; switching to an unlocked second preset verifies 62. A Wildcard Hero doing the same apply, collection activation and preset switch verifies none of 52, 39 and 62.",
